      "content": "thanks. so you're saying it's about the beta crystals specifically? i've been trying to follow a standard tempering curve but i'm still getting those white streaks. is there a specific part of the cooling or seeding stage where things usually go wrong? also, does the type of cocoa butter used affect how much \"bloom\" we might see?",
